Senior Frontend Developer (Pixi.js,Three.js) / iGaming

"Bykova Recruitment Agency"

$$$$

Продуктова компанія

We are looking for a Senior Frontend Developer with strong expertise in Pixi.js and Three.js to build engaging, high-performance interactive gaming experiences in the iGaming industry.

We are looking for an engineer who combines strong frontend development skills with a deep understanding of graphics rendering and interactive experiences.

Responsibilities:
- Develop and maintain interactive browser-based gaming applications using Pixi.js, Three.js, JavaScript, and TypeScript;
- Build responsive game interfaces, visual effects, animations, and interactive UI components;
- Translate design concepts and visual assets into high-quality, production-ready implementations;
- Collaborate with designers, artists, backend developers, QA engineers, and other stakeholders;
- Integrate frontend applications with backend services and APIs;
- Participate in architectural decisions, code reviews, and technical discussions.

Requirements
- 5+ years of commercial experience in frontend development;
- Strong proficiency in JavaScript and TypeScript;
- Hands-on experience with Pixi.js and Three.js;
- Solid understanding of HTML5, CSS3, Canvas, WebGL, and browser rendering;
- Experience with slot games, bonus rounds, or other interactive gaming mechanics;
- Experience building interactive, graphics-intensive, or game-related web applications;
- Strong understanding of frontend architecture, object-oriented programming, and software design principles;
- Experience integrating frontend applications with REST APIs or other backend services;

What We Offer
- The opportunity to work on interactive products in the iGaming industry;
- Fully remote work;
- Challenging technical tasks involving graphics, animation, and performance optimization;
- Collaboration with a cross-functional team of technical and creative specialists.

Необхідні навички

Pixi.js, Three.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, REST API

